message: "If you use MedReason-Bench in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MedReason-Bench: Clinical LLM Reasoning Evaluation in Cardiology and Autoimmune Disease"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, open-source benchmark for evaluating large language models on
  clinical reasoning tasks in cardiology and autoimmune disease, with explicit
  metrics for accuracy, calibration, hallucination, and demographic fairness.
